# An extension's popup saves a file with chrome.downloads as it opens. With Chrome's own UI the
# popup is a page CEF made no browser for, and CEF cancelled its downloads before Niche saw them
# ("No CefBrowser for download item"); they now go to the profile's last-used page (GitHub #218).
# promise: #218
home
budget rss=600 stalls50=5
niche://debug?installExtension=${FIXTURES}/DownloadExtension
relaunch
niche://open?url=${PAGE}?n=download
wait 3
niche://debug?extensionAction=${DOWNLOAD_EXTENSION_ID}
expect-log Download finished from a blob: address
niche://dismiss
niche://debug?removeExtension=${DOWNLOAD_EXTENSION_ID}
